WEBVTT

NOTE Cloud Guardian, Why Choose Us. 44 seconds, 6 scenes.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.066
Tuesday, eight in the morning. Susan runs accounts payable. An email from a client she has paid for years.

2
00:07.066 --> 00:16.400
Their bank has changed. Pay by Friday. Nothing seems off. Look closely. That is an R and an N, not an M.

3
00:16.400 --> 00:21.241
Susan never sees it. She sends the wire. Eighty four thousand.

4
00:21.241 --> 00:27.988
Wait. Cloud Guardian is their MSSP. It blocks the wire and the email. Susan never knew.

5
00:27.988 --> 00:34.245
The money stayed put. Nothing to disclose. That was never her job. It is ours.

6
00:34.245 --> 00:44.355
The chief executive hears at the quarterly review. Along with every attempt that never happened. Cloud Guardian. New Jersey and New York. Twice the quality, half the price.
